---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import SubscribeForm from "../components/SubscribeForm.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="Subscribe"
      description="Sign up for a weekly email reminder"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center article-header bg-hero p-25 text-black-900"
      >
        <h1>Subscribe</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4">
        <div class="col-span-2 bg-gradient"></div>
        <div
          class="col-span-10 main-content text-black-900lar padding-y-xxl"
        >
          <section>
            <h2>A Weekly Reminder</h2>

            <p>
              This won't be a long rambling newsletter that you might be used
              to. It is not for marketing purposes or spam. It will be a simple
              paragraph sent to your email with a link to the latest post.
              That's it. I want something simple that will act as a reminder to
              return to the website for new posts. Emails will go out weekly on
              Sundays when new blogs are published.
            </p>
            <SubscribeForm />

            <h2>Subscribe via RSS</h2>
            <p>
              There is a solution for you if you don't want another email. You
              can also subscribe using an RSS reader. In this way, new blog
              posts wil appear in a feed reader and you can click on links you
              find interesting. Skip the inbox entirely and visit a website that
              collects all your subscriptions in one place. Most websites will
              have a RSS subscription option. This <a
                href="https://aboutfeeds.com/"
                >guide will tell you more about how they work and how to set it
                up</a
              >.
            </p>
            <p class="btn">
              <a
                href="/rss.xml"
                class="p-5 rounded-lg bg-darkblue text-white-50"
                >Subscribe to the Suzza Stitches RSS Feed</a
              >
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <Footer />
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .btn a {
    color: #fafafa;
  }

  .btn a:visited {
    color: #fafafa;
  }
</style>
